\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Look up to mount Golgotha
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 What is it that you see?
\par It looks like a son of man
\par hanging up from a tree
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par A son of God and of man
\par He died because of that
\par O! what thanks does he deserve
\par Of this our Great Saviour.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  When His suffering ended
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He died, resurrected
\par ascended, into heaven
\par sat by His Father's side
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yet in His heavenly glory
\par return to earth again
\par Fear will grip people of this
\par world, people will rejoice
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. The day of judgment will come
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 and all shall be gathered
\par into His holy presence
\par Shall we fit into that?
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Jesus, full prepare us
\par because of your goodness
\par and we shall wait all alert
\par \pard         for this very great day.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

